WEBVTT

00:09.586 --> 00:09.724
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:11.068 --> 00:11.206
KIDS:
Aye, aye, Captain!
儿童：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.482 --> 00:12.620
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:14.172 --> 00:14.310
[ louder]:
Aye, aye, Captain!
[更大声]：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.758 --> 00:15.896
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:19.103 --> 00:19.241
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:21.034 --> 00:21.172
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:23.137 --> 00:23.275
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:25.344 --> 00:25.482
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:27.206 --> 00:27.344
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:29.137 --> 00:29.275
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:31.000 --> 00:31.137
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:33.172 --> 00:33.310
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:35.137 --> 00:35.275
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:36.965 --> 00:37.068
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.965 --> 00:40.068
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:41.275 --> 00:41.413
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:43.379 --> 00:43.517
[ laughs heartily]
[开怀大笑]

00:45.931 --> 00:46.034
[ plays airy tune]
Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
[演奏轻快的曲子]
字幕由 THE 赞助
美国教育部

00:49.206 --> 00:49.344
and NICKELODEON
和尼克国际儿童频道

01:02.586 --> 01:02.724
[ "Rule, Britannia" playing,
clock bell tolling]
[播放《统治，不列颠尼亚》，
钟声敲响]

01:06.827 --> 01:06.965
[ alarm beeping]
[警报声]

01:09.896 --> 01:10.000
Wow, I'm really late again.
哇，我真的又迟到了。

01:11.931 --> 01:12.034
Maybe they'll finally fire me.
也许他们最终会解雇我。

01:14.172 --> 01:14.310
[ laughing]
[笑]

01:16.206 --> 01:16.344
What? Locked?
什么？锁定了？

01:17.827 --> 01:17.965
SPONGEBOB:
This isn't happening.
海绵宝宝：
这并没有发生。

01:19.689 --> 01:19.827
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

01:21.241 --> 01:21.344
[ knocking head
against wall]
[ 敲头
靠墙]

01:22.724 --> 01:22.862
The horror--
恐怖的是——

01:23.896 --> 01:24.000
it's unspeakable.
这是无法形容的。

01:25.172 --> 01:25.310
Don't you see, Squidward?
你没看到吗，章鱼哥？

01:27.137 --> 01:27.275
It's closed!
关门了！

01:28.448 --> 01:28.586
The Krusty Krab is closed!
蟹堡王关门了！

01:30.275 --> 01:30.413
You mean I got out of bed
for nothing?
你的意思是我已经起床了
无缘无故？

01:32.310 --> 01:32.448
The doors are locked--
门锁着——

01:34.137 --> 01:34.275
the doors are locked
and we are on the outside!
门是锁着的
而我们在外面！

01:35.896 --> 01:36.000
Outsiders.
外人。

01:37.448 --> 01:37.586
What are we going to do?
我们要做什么？

01:39.206 --> 01:39.344
There are Krabby Patties inside
all alone.
里面有蟹黄饼
独自一人。

01:42.689 --> 01:42.827
KRABS:
Just stand aside, lad,
螃蟹：
就靠边站吧，小伙子，

01:44.413 --> 01:44.551
and let me unlock the door.
让我打开门。

01:46.551 --> 01:46.689
Mr. Krabs, you're here!
蟹老板，你来了！

01:48.103 --> 01:48.241
Gosh, Mr. Krabs,
we were worried
天啊，蟹老板，
我们很担心

01:49.827 --> 01:49.965
something might have
happened to you.
有些东西可能有
发生在你身上。

01:51.965 --> 01:52.068
We'd be deprived of
the greatest food
known to man.
我们会被剥夺
最好的食物
为人类所知。

01:54.896 --> 01:55.000
Oh, you made me
drop me keys.
哦，你让我
给我钥匙。

01:56.551 --> 01:56.689
Give me some space, lad!
给我一些空间，小伙子！

01:58.034 --> 01:58.172
Can't I get a little space?!
就不能给我一点空间吗？！

01:59.448 --> 01:59.586
I'm sorry, Mr. Krabs.
对不起，蟹老板。

02:01.965 --> 02:02.068
Harsh.
残酷的。

02:03.379 --> 02:03.517
[ laughing]
[笑]

02:04.965 --> 02:05.068
Argh! Me back!
啊！我回来了！

02:06.758 --> 02:06.896
Are you hurt,
Mr. Krabs?
你受伤了吗，
蟹老板？

02:08.344 --> 02:08.482
No, I'm just doubled over
in pain
不，我只是加倍了
痛苦中

02:10.517 --> 02:10.655
fighting back tears in me eyes
because it's a new dance craze!
强忍住眼中的泪水
因为这是一种新的舞蹈热潮！

02:14.965 --> 02:15.068
Oh, I thought
you were hurt.
哦，我以为
你受伤了。

02:16.310 --> 02:16.448
I am hurt, you idiot!
我受伤了，你这个白痴！

02:18.620 --> 02:18.758
I'm sorry I snapped
at you, laddie.
抱歉我突然爆发了
就在你身上，小伙子。

02:20.758 --> 02:20.896
It's just me back
is killing me.
只有我回来了
快要死了。

02:22.689 --> 02:22.827
It's me old lumpy mattress--
这是我的旧床垫——

02:24.551 --> 02:24.689
it's like trying to sleep
on broken coral.
就像想睡觉一样
在破碎的珊瑚上。

02:27.034 --> 02:27.172
I'm going out of me mind.
我快要疯了。

02:28.379 --> 02:28.517
Ouch!
哎哟!

02:29.413 --> 02:29.551
Oh, me back.
哦，我回来了。

02:30.586 --> 02:30.724
[ grumbling]
[抱怨]

02:31.758 --> 02:31.896
Poor Mr. Krabs.
可怜的蟹老板。

02:33.551 --> 02:33.689
What are we going to do,
Squidward?
我们要做什么，
章鱼哥？

02:35.206 --> 02:35.344
Why do anything?
为什么要做某事？

02:36.517 --> 02:36.655
I like the new Mr. Krabs--
我喜欢新的蟹老板先生——

02:37.862 --> 02:37.965
he yells at you more.
他对你大喊大叫。

02:39.137 --> 02:39.275
[ laughing]
[笑]

02:40.413 --> 02:40.551
I'm serious, Squidward.
我是认真的，章鱼哥。

02:41.655 --> 02:41.793
So am I.
我也是。

02:43.241 --> 02:43.379
We should get him
a new mattress
我们应该得到他
一个新床垫

02:44.655 --> 02:44.793
and surprise him
with it.
并给他一个惊喜
与它。

02:46.413 --> 02:46.551
Then we'll never have to
be late to work again.
那么我们就永远不必
上班又要迟到了。

02:48.482 --> 02:48.620
What?!
什么？！

02:50.103 --> 02:50.206
You want me to spend
my hard-earned money
你要我花
我的血汗钱

02:52.448 --> 02:52.586
on my richer-than-me
skinflint boss?
关于比我富有的人
肤浅的老板？

02:54.896 --> 02:55.000
No, thank you.
不，谢谢。

02:58.068 --> 02:58.206
That's okay, Squidward!
没关系，章鱼哥！

02:59.689 --> 02:59.827
You'll warm up to the idea.
你会对这个想法产生兴趣。

03:01.862 --> 03:01.965
Thanks for coming
with me, Patrick.
感谢您的光临
和我一起，帕特里克。

03:03.724 --> 03:03.862
No problem, buddy.
没问题，伙计。

03:05.482 --> 03:05.620
I always wanted to go
to a mattress store.
我一直想去
到床垫商店。

03:09.103 --> 03:09.241
Wow!
Wow!
哇！
哇！

03:11.103 --> 03:11.241
I've never seen
so many mattresses.
我从未见过
这么多床垫。

03:13.275 --> 03:13.413
Yeah.
是的。

03:14.827 --> 03:14.965
How many do you think
there are?
你认为有多少
有吗？

03:21.275 --> 03:21.413
Ten.
十。

03:22.206 --> 03:22.344
Cool.
凉爽的。

03:23.793 --> 03:23.931
There's plenty more
than that.
还有很多
比那个。

03:25.379 --> 03:25.517
Try 'em out--
find one you like.
尝试一下——
找到一个你喜欢的。

03:26.689 --> 03:26.827
[ springs squeaking]
[弹簧吱吱声]

03:29.000 --> 03:29.137
[ air hissing]
[空气嘶嘶声]

03:31.482 --> 03:31.620
[ clanking]
[叮当作响]

03:33.413 --> 03:33.551
[ spluttering,
imitating car engine]
[ 溅射，
模仿汽车发动机]

03:37.172 --> 03:37.310
[ tires squeal, crashing]
[轮胎发出尖叫声、撞击声]

03:43.172 --> 03:43.310
[ motor whirring]
[马达嗡嗡作响]

03:48.344 --> 03:48.482
Ooh!
哦！

03:49.620 --> 03:49.758
[ laughing]
[笑]

03:51.344 --> 03:51.482
[ SpongeBob
and Patrick laughing]
[ 海绵宝宝
帕特里克笑了]

03:54.655 --> 03:54.793
[ laughter continues]
[笑声继续]

04:00.655 --> 04:00.793
What are you morons doing?!
你们这些白痴在做什么？！

04:02.379 --> 04:02.517
Making a card for Mr. Krabs.
为蟹老板制作一张卡片。

04:04.275 --> 04:04.413
To go with his new mattress.
搭配他的新床垫。

04:06.379 --> 04:06.517
Oh, I see, you're just
kissing up to the boss
哦，我明白了，你只是
给老板拍马屁

04:09.448 --> 04:09.586
to make me look bad!
让我难看！

04:10.896 --> 04:11.000
Well, I won't stand for it!
好吧，我不会容忍的！

04:12.379 --> 04:12.517
Give me that card!
把那张卡给我！

04:13.931 --> 04:14.034
Hmm! Trying to outsmart me,
will you?
唔！试图智取我，
你会吗？

04:16.034 --> 04:16.172
Ha-ha!
哈哈！

04:17.655 --> 04:17.793
There, I signed it
for all of us.
在那里，我签了字
对于我们所有人来说。

04:19.137 --> 04:19.275
Hey, you didn't even help pay.
嘿嘿，你连钱都没帮忙。

04:21.206 --> 04:21.344
Oh, that's okay.
哦，没关系。

04:22.586 --> 04:22.724
As long as Mr. Krabs is happy.
只要蟹老板开心就好。

04:27.413 --> 04:27.551
KRABS:
Oh, me back!
螃蟹：
哦，我回来了！

04:29.448 --> 04:29.586
Well, here goes
another useless attempt
好吧，就这样
又一次无用的尝试

04:32.103 --> 04:32.241
to sleep on me mountainous,
lumpy mattress.
睡在我的山上，
凹凸不平的床垫。

04:34.965 --> 04:35.068
Argh!
啊！

04:36.551 --> 04:36.689
[ groaning]
[呻吟]

04:38.344 --> 04:38.482
That's queer-- me mattress seems
strangely cozy
这很奇怪——我的床垫似乎
异常舒适

04:41.379 --> 04:41.517
and... butter... like.
还有……黄油……之类的。

04:44.000 --> 04:44.103
[ snoring]
[打鼾]

04:47.275 --> 04:47.413
ALL:
Surprise!
全部：
惊喜！

04:48.862 --> 04:48.965
Armageddon! What?
世界末日！什么？

04:49.931 --> 04:50.034
You? Oh! You?
你？哦！你？

04:51.896 --> 04:52.000
What in a blue-eyed scallop
are you doing in me bedroom?
蓝眼扇贝里有什么
你在我卧室里做什么？

04:54.275 --> 04:54.413
We noticed how miserable
you were
我们注意到多么悲惨
你是

04:56.000 --> 04:56.103
on your lumpy, old mattress...
在你凹凸不平的旧床垫上......

04:57.862 --> 04:57.965
So Isuggested
we get you a new one.
所以我建议
我们给你买了一件新的。

05:00.655 --> 05:00.793
I thought it was
your idea.
我以为是
你的想法。

05:02.758 --> 05:02.896
So, where's
me old mattress then?[ steam whistling]
那么，哪里是
那么我的旧床垫吗？[蒸汽呼啸]

05:05.379 --> 05:05.517
Don't worry, I took care of that
personally, too.
别担心，我已经处理好了
就个人而言，也是如此。

05:08.206 --> 05:08.344
I had it hauled away
to the dump.
我把它拖走了
到垃圾场。

05:10.000 --> 05:10.103
[ Krabs shouting]
[螃蟹大喊]

05:12.275 --> 05:12.413
All... my... money
was in that mattress!
所有...我的...钱
就在那个床垫里！

05:15.965 --> 05:16.068
What?!
什么？！

05:17.517 --> 05:17.655
Haven't you ever heard of
a bank?!
你有没有听说过
银行？！

05:18.896 --> 05:19.000
No!
不！

05:20.689 --> 05:20.827
[ groaning, babbling]
[呻吟，胡言乱语]

05:24.931 --> 05:25.034
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

05:26.379 --> 05:26.517
No...!
不...！

05:28.310 --> 05:28.448
And we got you
a card.
我们找到了你
一张卡。

05:29.965 --> 05:30.068
Is there money in it?
里面有钱吗？

05:31.034 --> 05:31.172
Nope.
没有。

05:32.172 --> 05:32.310
[ groans]
[呻吟]

05:33.379 --> 05:33.517
[ siren wailing]
[警笛哀嚎]

05:34.827 --> 05:34.965
[ tires squeal]
[轮胎吱吱声]

05:36.448 --> 05:36.586
SPONGEBOB:
Is it serious, Doctor?
海绵宝宝：
医生，严重吗？

05:37.965 --> 05:38.068
Will Mr. Krabs
be all right?
蟹老板威尔先生
没事吧？

05:39.413 --> 05:39.551
Mr. Krabs is in a cash-coma.
蟹老板正处于现金昏迷状态。

05:41.655 --> 05:41.793
Only the return of his money
can save his life.
只归还他的钱
可以救他的命。

05:44.310 --> 05:44.448
It was
SpongeBob's fault!
原来是
都是海绵宝宝的错！

05:46.310 --> 05:46.413
Getting Mr. Krabs
a new mattress
was hisidea!
得到蟹老板
一个新床垫
是他的主意！

05:49.068 --> 05:49.206
I knew it!
我就知道！

05:50.103 --> 05:50.241
Not so fast!
没那么快！

05:52.000 --> 05:52.103
This card says, "This was all
my idea! Love, Squidward."
这张卡片上写着：“这就是全部
我的主意！爱你，章鱼哥。”

05:55.862 --> 05:55.965
If Mr. Krabs doesn't
pull through,
如果蟹老板不这样做
渡过难关，

05:58.241 --> 05:58.379
you're going to jail.
你会进监狱的。

06:00.103 --> 06:00.241
Oh... you did this,
SquarePants!
哦...你做了这个，
方裤！

06:02.482 --> 06:02.620
If you don't get
Mr. Krabs' mattress back,
如果你没有得到
蟹老板的床垫靠背，

06:04.862 --> 06:04.965
I am going to mur...
我要去默...

06:06.241 --> 06:06.379
[ policeman clears throat]
[警察清嗓子]

06:07.689 --> 06:07.827
[ laughing nervously]
[紧张地笑]

06:09.620 --> 06:09.758
Help you do it myself.
自己帮你做吧。

06:12.000 --> 06:12.103
Wow, he really does care.
哇，他真的很关心。

06:14.586 --> 06:14.724
PATRICK:
What a dump.
帕特里克：
真是一个垃圾场。

06:16.517 --> 06:16.655
[ gate rattling]
[大门嘎嘎作响]

06:18.103 --> 06:18.241
We've got to get
in there, Squidward.
我们必须得到
在那里，章鱼哥。

06:19.689 --> 06:19.827
Mr. Krabs is counting on us.
蟹老板指望着我们。

06:21.241 --> 06:21.379
PATRICK:
SpongeBob, isn't that
帕特里克：
海绵宝宝不是吗

06:22.689 --> 06:22.827
the mattress over there?
床垫在那边吗？

06:24.206 --> 06:24.344
Terrific, Patrick,
you found it!
太棒了，帕特里克，
你找到了！

06:25.793 --> 06:25.931
What? Where? Let me see!
什么？在哪里？让我看看！

06:27.241 --> 06:27.379
Over there, Squidward,
那边，章鱼哥，

06:28.896 --> 06:29.000
underneath that really big
guard worm.
下面真的很大
守卫蠕虫。

06:30.689 --> 06:30.827
[ worm growling, snoring]
[蠕虫咆哮，打鼾]

06:32.241 --> 06:32.379
Oh, that figures.
哦，这个数字。

06:35.689 --> 06:35.827
Oh, no!
哦，不！

06:36.896 --> 06:37.000
This is horrible.
这太可怕了。

06:38.068 --> 06:38.206
What is it, Doctor?
什么事，医生？

06:39.344 --> 06:39.482
This man has no insurance.
这个人没有保险。

06:41.034 --> 06:41.172
He'll never be able
to afford this room.
他永远无法
买得起这个房间。

06:42.586 --> 06:42.724
You're right, nurse.
你说得对，护士。

06:43.896 --> 06:44.000
Extract the patient, stat!
救出病人，统计！

06:47.137 --> 06:47.275
[ Krabs groaning]
[螃蟹呻吟]

06:49.655 --> 06:49.793
SPONGEBOB:
Well, that's Mr. Krabs' mattress
all right.
海绵宝宝：
Well, that's Mr. Krabs' mattress
好吧。

06:52.586 --> 06:52.724
Let's go get it.
我们去拿吧。

06:53.689 --> 06:53.827
Here's the plan:
计划如下：

06:55.000 --> 06:55.137
You two quietly go in there,
你们两个悄悄进去吧

06:57.068 --> 06:57.206
remove the mattress
out from under the guard worm
拆掉床垫
从守卫蠕虫下面出来

06:59.551 --> 06:59.689
without "waking the worm."
无需“唤醒蠕虫”。

07:02.551 --> 07:02.689
Why not?
为什么不呢？

07:04.103 --> 07:04.206
Because that would
be rude, Patrick.
因为那样会
粗鲁一点，帕特里克。

07:05.862 --> 07:05.965
And nothing's meaner
than a junkyard worm.
没有什么比这更卑鄙的了
比垃圾场蠕虫。

07:08.310 --> 07:08.448
He'll eat you alive!
他会活活吃掉你！

07:09.620 --> 07:09.758
Hey, wait a minute.
嘿，等一下。

07:10.896 --> 07:11.000
What are you going to do?
你会怎样做？

07:12.551 --> 07:12.689
Oh, I've got
the most important job.
哦，我有
最重要的工作。

07:14.689 --> 07:14.827
I'm going to keep watch
to make sure it's safe.
我会继续观察
以确保其安全。

07:17.793 --> 07:17.931
Gee, thanks, buddy.
哎呀，谢谢，伙计。

07:19.000 --> 07:19.137
My pleasure.
我的荣幸。

07:20.482 --> 07:20.620
Now let's get
a move on.
现在让我们得到
继续前进。

07:23.068 --> 07:23.206
[ laughing]
[笑]

07:25.448 --> 07:25.586
[ panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:27.689 --> 07:27.827
Ah, isn't it beautiful,
Patrick?
啊，不是很美吗
帕特里克？

07:30.068 --> 07:30.206
SPONGEBOB:
You can see everything
from up here.
海绵宝宝：
你可以看到一切
从这里。

07:32.379 --> 07:32.517
PATRICK:
Wow!
帕特里克：
哇！

07:33.448 --> 07:33.586
[ sighs]
[叹气]

07:34.758 --> 07:34.896
What are you morons doing?
你们这些白痴在做什么？

07:36.793 --> 07:36.931
Hey, Patrick, I think
I can see our houses
from here.
嘿，帕特里克，我想
我可以看到我们的房子
从这里。

07:38.862 --> 07:38.965
PATRICK:
Where? I can't see 'em.
帕特里克：
哪里？我看不见他们。

07:41.172 --> 07:41.310
[ all shouting]
[大家大喊]

07:43.068 --> 07:43.206
Wow!
Wow!
哇！
哇！

07:44.517 --> 07:44.655
[ laughing]
[笑]

07:45.689 --> 07:45.827
Let's do it again!
让我们再做一次吧！

07:47.448 --> 07:47.586
What did you idiots do?
你们这些白痴做了什么？

07:49.137 --> 07:49.275
Squidward, what are you doing
in there?
章鱼哥，你在做什么
在那里？

07:50.793 --> 07:50.931
You were supposed to keep watch!
你应该保持警惕！

07:52.620 --> 07:52.758
Yeah, and you woke up
the guard worm, too!
是的，然后你就醒了
还有守卫蠕虫！

07:54.862 --> 07:54.965
I didn't do it!
我没有做！

07:56.551 --> 07:58.793
You blockheads woke...[ worm growling]
你们这些笨蛋醒了……[蠕虫咆哮]

07:58.793 --> 07:58.931
the... worm.
……蠕虫。

08:01.000 --> 08:01.137
[ Squidward screaming,
fabric tearing, worm growling]
[章鱼哥尖叫，
织物撕裂，蠕虫咆哮]

08:05.482 --> 08:05.620
DOCTOR:
Doctor?
医生：
医生？

08:06.862 --> 08:06.965
DOCTOR 2:
Yes, Doctor.
医生2：
是的，医生。

08:08.862 --> 08:08.965
Regarding your patient,
I have come to this conclusion.
关于你的病人，
我得出了这个结论。

08:11.172 --> 08:11.310
Yes, go on.
!
We have to remove him
是的，继续。
！
我们必须除掉他

08:12.862 --> 08:12.965
from in front of
the candy machine
从前面
糖果机

08:14.689 --> 08:14.827
so I can get to
the Nutty-Nut Bar.
这样我就可以到达
坚果酒吧。

08:16.482 --> 08:16.620
Of course.
Nurse!
当然。
护士！

08:17.586 --> 08:17.724
I'm on it.
我正在做。

08:23.689 --> 08:23.827
[ Krabs groaning]
[螃蟹呻吟]

08:29.655 --> 08:29.793
Worm Bait to Retriever,
猎犬的蠕虫诱饵，

08:31.241 --> 08:31.379
Worm Bait to Retriever,
we're in.
猎犬的蠕虫诱饵，
我们进来了。

08:32.620 --> 08:32.758
Out.
出去。

08:33.896 --> 08:34.000
Retriever to Worm Bait,
猎犬到蠕虫诱饵，

08:35.172 --> 08:35.310
stay in,don't go out.
留在里面，不要出去。

08:36.482 --> 08:36.620
Understood. Out.
明白了。出去。

08:37.655 --> 08:37.793
No, in! Out.
不，在！出去。

08:39.034 --> 08:40.620
Understood. Out.
明白了。出去。

08:40.655 --> 08:42.689
SQUIDWARD:
You're on the far side
of the dump?
章鱼哥：
你在远方
垃圾场的？

08:42.689 --> 08:42.827
Affirmative.
肯定。

08:43.965 --> 08:45.000
Good, then make lots of noise
好，那就大声喧哗

08:45.000 --> 08:45.137
to draw the guard worm
画守卫蠕虫

08:46.827 --> 08:46.965
away from the mattress
so I can retrieve it.
远离床垫
这样我就可以找回它。

08:48.310 --> 08:48.448
Affirmative. Out.
肯定。出去。

08:50.068 --> 08:50.206
Oh, that's why he calls
himself the Retriever.
哦，这就是他打电话的原因
他自己就是猎犬。

08:52.103 --> 08:52.241
Why are we called
Worm Bait?
为什么我们被称为
蠕虫诱饵？

08:53.551 --> 08:53.689
I don't know.
我不知道。

08:54.689 --> 08:54.827
[ ululating]
[哀嚎]

08:55.689 --> 08:55.827
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

08:56.931 --> 08:57.034
[ both ululating]
[两人都在尖叫]

08:59.448 --> 08:59.586
Great idea, Patrick!
好主意，帕特里克！

09:02.448 --> 09:02.586
[ ululating and banging]
[尖叫和敲击]

09:04.206 --> 09:04.344
[ growling]
[咆哮]

09:05.896 --> 09:06.000
And my perfect plan
falls into place.
还有我的完美计划
就位。

09:08.482 --> 09:08.620
[ laughing]
[笑]

09:09.931 --> 09:10.034
[ ululating and banging]
[尖叫和敲击]

09:11.793 --> 09:11.931
Uh, SpongeBob?
呃，海绵宝宝？

09:12.862 --> 09:12.965
Yes, Patrick?
是的，帕特里克？

09:14.793 --> 09:16.758
I think I know why
our code name
is Worm Bait.
我想我知道为什么
我们的代号
是虫饵。

09:16.758 --> 09:16.896
[ growling]
[咆哮]

09:19.448 --> 09:19.586
[ stammering]:
Nice worm.
[结巴]：
好虫子。

09:21.206 --> 09:21.344
Good, kind, gentle worm.
善良、善良、温柔的蠕虫。

09:23.586 --> 09:23.724
[ snarling]
[咆哮]

09:24.724 --> 09:24.862
Ooh!
哦！

09:26.379 --> 09:26.517
[ panting happily]
[高兴地喘气]

09:28.344 --> 09:28.482
Oh, SpongeBob,
he likes your wooden spoon.
哦，海绵宝宝，
他喜欢你的木勺。

09:31.241 --> 09:31.379
Huh?
啊？

09:34.275 --> 09:34.413
Wow, I think
you're right, Patrick.
哇，我想
你是对的，帕特里克。

09:36.137 --> 09:36.275
See if he plays catch!
看看他会不会接球！

09:37.586 --> 09:37.724
Okay.
好的。

09:38.758 --> 09:38.896
See the stick, boy.
看到棍子了，孩子。

09:39.862 --> 09:39.965
Go get it, boy!
去拿吧，孩子！

09:40.931 --> 09:41.034
[ barks]
[吠叫]

09:42.034 --> 09:42.172
Coast is clear.
海岸清澈。

09:43.344 --> 09:43.482
Squiddy, you are a genius.
乌贼，你真是个天才。

09:45.724 --> 09:45.862
Ouch! What the...?
哎哟!什么……？

09:47.068 --> 09:47.206
Hey, I needed a wooden spoon.
嘿，我需要一把木勺。

09:48.965 --> 09:49.068
I'll just keep it safe from harm
in my back pocket.
我会保护它免受伤害
在我后面的口袋里。

09:52.103 --> 09:52.241
And now for the mattress.
现在来说说床垫。

09:53.827 --> 09:53.965
[ fabric rips,
Squidward grunts]
[ 织物撕裂，
章鱼哥咕哝]

09:55.310 --> 09:55.448
I should have guessed.
我早该猜到的。

09:58.103 --> 09:58.241
[ Squidward screaming]
[章鱼哥尖叫]

10:02.965 --> 10:03.068
Excuse me, Doctor.
对不起，医生。

10:04.551 --> 10:04.689
Administrator,
what can I do for you?
管理员，
我能为你做什么？

10:05.896 --> 10:06.000
It has come to my attention
它引起了我的注意

10:07.965 --> 10:08.068
that your patient, Mr. Krabs,
is out on the front sidewalk.
你的病人，克拉布斯先生，
就在前面的人行道上。

10:10.482 --> 10:10.620
Yes. Yes, he is.
是的。是的，他是。

10:12.000 --> 10:12.137
What were
you thinking, man?
什么是
你在想吗，伙计？

10:13.620 --> 10:13.758
We're trying to run
a business.
我们正在努力奔跑
一项业务。

10:15.344 --> 10:15.482
We can't leave patients
on the sidewalk.
我们不能丢下病人
在人行道上。

10:16.655 --> 10:16.793
Not to worry. Nurse!
不用担心。护士！

10:18.034 --> 10:18.172
I'm on it.
我正在做。

10:24.517 --> 10:24.655
What's the holdup?!
还愣着啥？！

10:26.000 --> 10:26.137
SPONGEBOB:
We feel silly!
海绵宝宝：
我们觉得自己很傻！

10:28.344 --> 10:28.482
Come on, do it
for old man Krabs.
来吧，做吧
给蟹老爷子的。

10:30.620 --> 10:30.758
SPONGEBOB:
Okay.
海绵宝宝：
好的。

10:32.517 --> 10:32.655
Can you explain the plan again?
你能再解释一下这个计划吗？

10:34.517 --> 10:34.655
Sure, but first,
put on this cologne.
当然可以，但首先，
喷上这款古龙水。

10:37.275 --> 10:37.413
Steak sauce?
牛排酱？

10:40.206 --> 10:40.344
Okay, so you two are dressed
as choice cuts.
好吧，你们两个都穿好了
随着选择的减少。

10:43.827 --> 10:43.965
You go in there
你进去那里

10:45.310 --> 10:45.448
and yell
"Trick or treat!"
并大喊大叫
“不给糖就捣蛋！”

10:47.379 --> 10:50.448
The worm will realize he forgot
to stock up on Halloween candy,
蠕虫会意识到他忘记了
储备万圣节糖果，

10:50.448 --> 10:50.586
he'll leave to buy some,
then we take the mattress.
他会离开去买一些，
然后我们拿床垫。

10:53.379 --> 10:53.517
Give me that cologne.
把那瓶古龙水给我。

10:56.172 --> 10:56.310
Now get in there!
现在进去吧！

10:57.827 --> 10:57.965
SPONGEBOB:
Happy Halloween!
海绵宝宝：
万圣节快乐！

10:59.724 --> 10:59.862
I am notgoing to get hurt
this time.
我不会受伤
这次。

11:01.482 --> 11:01.620
[ rattling]
[嘎嘎声]

11:04.000 --> 11:04.103
What the...?
什么……？

11:05.137 --> 11:06.206
Isn't that Mr. Krabs?
那不是蟹老板吗？

11:06.206 --> 11:06.344
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

11:11.620 --> 11:11.758
[ growling]
[咆哮]

11:13.275 --> 11:13.413
That guard worm
doesn't look very happy.
那个守卫虫
看起来不太高兴。

11:15.448 --> 11:15.586
Run, Mr. Krabs!
快跑吧，蟹老板！

11:16.827 --> 11:16.965
Run like you're not in a coma!
快跑吧，就像你没有处于昏迷状态一样！

11:19.206 --> 11:19.344
[ sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

11:20.517 --> 11:20.655
[ growling]
[咆哮]

11:21.655 --> 11:21.793
It's... me money!
这是……我的钱！

11:22.758 --> 11:22.896
[ snarling]
[咆哮]

11:23.862 --> 11:23.965
[ growling]
[咆哮]

11:25.000 --> 11:25.137
[ worm yelps]
[蠕虫叫声]

11:26.034 --> 11:26.172
Oh, money!
哦，钱！

11:27.793 --> 11:27.931
I promise I'll never leave
you alone again.
我保证我永远不会离开
你又一个人了。

11:29.379 --> 11:29.517
Hey, Mr. Krabs.
嘿，蟹老板。

11:30.482 --> 11:30.620
[ barking]
[吠叫]

11:31.758 --> 11:31.896
No, Mr. Krabs, it's us.
不，蟹老板，是我们。

11:32.862 --> 11:32.965
Trick or treat.
不给糖就捣蛋。

11:34.034 --> 11:34.172
Oh, hey, SpongeBob.
哦，嘿，海绵宝宝。

11:35.310 --> 11:35.448
I didn't recognize you.
我没认出你来。

11:36.965 --> 11:37.068
Say, why are you two
dressed as meat?
说吧，你们两个为什么
打扮成肉？

11:39.068 --> 11:39.206
Not just meat--
we're choice cuts.
不仅仅是肉——
我们是选择削减。

11:41.172 --> 11:41.310
Right, Squidward?
对吧，章鱼哥？

11:42.379 --> 11:42.517
Oh, I give up.
哦，我放弃了。

11:43.965 --> 11:44.068
[ worm snarling]
[蠕虫咆哮]

11:45.103 --> 11:45.241
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

11:46.482 --> 11:46.620
[ screaming and shouting]
[尖叫和喊叫]

12:01.448 --> 12:01.586
[ clam crowing like a rooster]
[蛤蜊像公鸡一样打鸣]

12:05.689 --> 12:05.827
[ sound like cloth tearing]
[声音像布料撕裂]

12:07.551 --> 12:07.689
And so passes
another sleepless night
就这样过去了
又一个不眠之夜

12:12.172 --> 12:12.310
haunted by my inability to steal
even a single Krabby Patty.
因我无法偷窃而困扰
甚至是一个蟹肉饼。

12:18.448 --> 12:18.586
Maybe today will be
the day.
也许今天会是
那天。

12:20.655 --> 12:20.793
Thank you for
your patronizing words,
谢谢你
你的居高临下的话语，

12:23.620 --> 12:23.758
computer wife.
电脑老婆。

12:24.862 --> 12:24.965
Do you even have a plan?
你有计划吗？

12:26.517 --> 12:26.655
Plan, schman--
I'm going to wing it.
计划，施曼——
我要即兴发挥。

12:28.965 --> 12:29.068
What's the worst thing
that could happen?
最糟糕的事情是什么
这可能发生吗？

12:33.965 --> 12:34.068
I'm in.
我进来了

12:35.586 --> 12:35.724
That was easy.
那很容易。

12:36.827 --> 12:36.965
Maybe today is the day
也许今天就是这样的日子

12:38.655 --> 12:38.793
I'm going to steal
the Krabby Patty formula...
我要去偷
蟹黄饼配方...

12:42.448 --> 12:42.586
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

12:43.931 --> 12:44.034
Careful,
I just mopped there.
小心，
我刚刚拖了那里。

12:45.275 --> 12:45.413
[ groans]
[呻吟]

12:46.931 --> 12:47.034
Look at you, Plankton,
看看你，浮游生物，

12:48.620 --> 12:48.758
Once again you've fallen
flat on your back
你再一次跌倒了
平躺在你的背上

12:51.310 --> 12:51.448
in another pathetic attempt
to steal me formula.
在另一个可悲的尝试中
偷我的配方。

12:54.241 --> 12:54.379
Though you tried
and tried,
虽然你尝试过
并尝试过，

12:56.482 --> 12:56.620
you haven't had
the smallest nibble
你还没有
最小的一口

12:59.344 --> 12:59.482
of my delicious formula.
我的美味配方。

13:01.379 --> 13:01.517
And you never will!
而你永远不会！

13:02.758 --> 13:02.896
[ laughing]
[笑]

13:04.068 --> 13:04.206
How do you sleep at night
你晚上睡得怎么样

13:05.724 --> 13:05.862
knowing you're
a complete failure?
知道你是
彻底失败？

13:08.448 --> 13:08.586
There really should be
a "Wet Floor" sign.
确实应该有
“湿地板”标志。

13:11.137 --> 13:11.275
Yeah, if that were me
who slipped,
是的，如果那是我
谁滑倒了，

13:13.206 --> 13:13.344
I'd sue old man Krabs
我要起诉蟹老爷子

13:14.586 --> 13:14.724
for all
he's got.
为所有人
他有。

13:16.310 --> 13:16.448
Does that include
the Krabby Patty formula?
这包括吗
蟹黄饼配方？

13:18.689 --> 13:18.827
Of course.
当然。

13:21.724 --> 13:21.862
Oh, the pain!
哦，痛苦！

13:23.482 --> 13:23.620
I can't feel my arms and legs!
我感觉不到我的胳膊和腿了！

13:26.275 --> 13:26.413
I think they're broken.
我认为他们坏了。

13:28.413 --> 13:28.551
I'll have to sue
for my pain and suffering.
我将不得不起诉
为了我的痛苦和磨难。

13:31.344 --> 13:31.482
Sue?!
起诉？！

13:32.517 --> 13:32.655
Oh, that looks bad.
哦，那看起来很糟糕。

13:33.793 --> 13:33.931
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

13:34.896 --> 13:35.000
Poor little man.
可怜的小男人。

13:38.965 --> 13:39.068
Hold up a second!
等一下！

13:40.827 --> 13:40.965
Plankton, we don't need
to drag this little incident
浮游生物，我们不需要
拖这个小事件

13:42.758 --> 13:42.896
into court, do we?
上法庭，是吗？

13:43.793 --> 13:43.931
Well...
出色地...

13:45.586 --> 13:48.000
if you transfer
the Krabby Patty formula to me,
如果你转移
对我来说，蟹黄派的配方，

13:48.000 --> 13:48.103
I'll forget
your gross negligence.
我会忘记
你的重大疏忽。

13:50.068 --> 13:50.206
Scoundrel!
恶棍！

13:51.344 --> 13:51.482
You'll have my formula
你会得到我的公式

13:53.000 --> 13:53.137
when you pry it
from me lifeless claws!
当你撬开它时
来自我毫无生气的爪子！

13:54.551 --> 13:54.689
[ laughing sinisterly]
[阴险地笑]

13:56.413 --> 13:56.551
See you in court, Krabs!
蟹老板，法庭见！

13:58.620 --> 13:58.758
Uh, I mean...
呃，我的意思是...

13:59.896 --> 14:00.068
Oh, the pain!
哦，痛苦！

14:01.793 --> 14:01.931
The deep frying
pain!
油炸
痛苦！

14:05.448 --> 14:05.586
I'm in a blue ruin.
我在一片蓝色废墟中。

14:07.344 --> 14:07.482
I'm doomed.
我注定了。

14:09.206 --> 14:11.689
Don't worry, Mr. Krabs,
I will do whatever it takes
别担心，蟹老板，
我会不惜一切代价

14:11.689 --> 14:11.827
to keep the Krusty Krab formula
保留蟹堡王配方

14:13.448 --> 14:13.586
from getting into
Plankton's evil hands.
从进入
浮游生物的邪恶之手。

14:15.896 --> 14:16.000
What I really need is
a good lawyer.
我真正需要的是
一个好律师。

14:18.000 --> 14:18.103
Hello, did somebody
say "lawyer"?
你好，有人吗
说“律师”？

14:19.724 --> 14:19.862
Richard A. Bottomfeeder,
Attorney At Law.
理查德·A·底部喂食者，
律师。

14:22.206 --> 14:22.344
I couldn't help but notice
that despicable display.
我忍不住注意到
那种卑鄙的表现。

14:25.241 --> 14:25.379
So, uh, how much is this
going to cost me?
那么，呃，这个多少钱
会让我付出代价吗？

14:27.689 --> 14:27.827
Actually, I won't charge you
a dime unless we win.
其实我不会向你收费
除非我们赢了，否则一毛钱。

14:30.000 --> 14:30.137
[ cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

14:31.689 --> 14:31.827
In fact, I think
we should counter sue
其实我觉得
我们应该反诉

14:33.793 --> 14:33.931
for everything Plankton owns.
Plankton 拥有的一切。

14:35.448 --> 14:35.586
[ cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

14:37.137 --> 14:37.275
[ clanking]
[叮当作响]

14:38.517 --> 14:38.655
Does that happen
a lot?
会发生这种情况吗
很多？

14:40.034 --> 14:40.172
No, they're
usually silver.
不，他们是
通常是银的。

14:41.172 --> 14:41.310
[ humming]
[嗡嗡声]

14:44.379 --> 14:44.517
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

14:45.482 --> 14:45.620
What is it, lad?
这是什么，小伙子？

14:46.896 --> 14:47.000
Want to hear
my testimony
想听
我的见证

14:48.689 --> 14:48.827
for when you call me
as a character witness?
当你打电话给我时
作为品格见证人？

14:49.965 --> 14:50.068
I've been rehearsing it.
我一直在排练。

14:51.344 --> 14:51.482
Actually, SpongeBob,
事实上，海绵宝宝，

14:53.068 --> 14:53.206
we won't be needing
any testimony from you.
我们不需要
你的任何证词。

14:55.034 --> 14:55.172
Why, you'd be
more of a...
为什么，你会是
更多的是...

14:56.724 --> 14:56.862
[ whispering]
[低语]

14:58.172 --> 14:58.310
of a liability
than an asset.
一项责任的
比资产。

14:59.689 --> 14:59.827
But I...
但我...

15:00.862 --> 15:00.965
Now, run along--
现在，一起跑吧——

15:02.655 --> 15:04.172
make things shipshape
for my victory celebration.
使事情井然有序
庆祝我的胜利。

15:04.172 --> 15:04.310
I've got to get
to the courthouse.
我必须得到
到法院。

15:05.862 --> 15:05.965
There's only a few
free parking places.
只有几个
免费停车位。

15:08.137 --> 15:08.275
Oh, this is going to be
a slam dunk...
哦，这将会是
扣篮...

15:10.758 --> 15:10.896
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

15:12.000 --> 15:12.137
Oh, no!
哦，不！

15:13.551 --> 15:13.689
Mr. Krabs's lawyer!
蟹老板的律师！

15:15.137 --> 15:15.275
Speak to me!
跟我说话吧！

15:16.310 --> 15:16.448
Wracked with pain...
痛苦万分...

15:18.000 --> 15:18.137
Can't move...
不能动...

15:19.793 --> 15:19.931
But what about
Mr. Krabs's case?
但是呢
蟹老板的案子？

15:21.827 --> 15:21.965
Looks like you're going to have
to handle this one, son.
看起来你将会有
来处理这件事，儿子。

15:24.586 --> 15:24.724
But I'm a...
但我是一个...

15:25.931 --> 15:26.034
a liability.
一项责任。

15:27.655 --> 15:27.793
Everything
you need to win...
一切
你需要赢……

15:28.931 --> 15:29.034
[ gasping]
[喘气]

15:30.137 --> 15:30.275
is in this here case.
在这种情况下。

15:32.793 --> 15:32.931
Really?
Everything?
真的吗？
一切？

15:34.137 --> 15:34.275
Uh-huh, everything but a suit.
嗯嗯，除了西装什么都有。

15:36.620 --> 15:36.758
A suit.
一套西装。

15:38.000 --> 15:38.103
Wonder where I could get a suit.
想知道哪里可以买到一套西装。

15:39.896 --> 15:40.000
[ The People's Court
theme music plays]
[ 人民法院
主题音乐播放]

15:44.965 --> 15:45.068
I'll give you one last chance.
我会给你最后一次机会。

15:49.000 --> 15:49.103
I'll drop the charges
if you give me the formula.
我会撤销指控
如果你给我公式。

15:52.586 --> 15:52.724
Never, you little whelp!
从来没有，你这个小崽子！

15:54.103 --> 15:54.206
[ crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

15:55.310 --> 15:55.448
Ow, ow, my wittle arm!
噢，噢，我的灵巧的手臂！

15:58.482 --> 15:58.620
[ crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

15:59.965 --> 16:00.137
What? No, I didn't
lay a claw on him.
什么？不，我没有
用爪子抓他。

16:02.241 --> 16:02.379
Ow... my other arm!
哎呀……我的另一只手臂！

16:05.344 --> 16:05.482
[ crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

16:06.517 --> 16:06.655
He's lying!
他在撒谎！

16:07.862 --> 16:07.965
Bah!
呸!

16:09.275 --> 16:09.413
Court will come
to order.
法庭会来
订购。

16:11.103 --> 16:11.241
The Honorable
Judge Tickleback
presiding.
尊敬的
提克贝克法官
主持。

16:12.758 --> 16:12.896
Mr. Krabs, where is
your attorney?
螃蟹先生，在哪里？
你的律师？

16:14.413 --> 16:14.551
I don't know
where he could be.
我不知道
他可能在哪里。

16:16.965 --> 16:17.068
[ crashing]
[崩溃]

16:18.000 --> 16:18.103
Here I am!
我在这里！

16:19.724 --> 16:19.862
Thank you for joining us,
Mister...
感谢您加入我们，
先生...

16:21.758 --> 16:21.896
SpongeBob Lawyerpants,
Your Honor.
海绵宝宝律师裤，
法官阁下。

16:24.689 --> 16:24.827
[ softly]:
What are you doing here,
SpongeBob?
[轻声]：
你在这里做什么，
海绵宝宝？

16:28.000 --> 16:28.103
Your lawyer, uh,
fell down on the job.
你的律师，呃，
在工作中摔倒了。

16:30.000 --> 16:30.137
But don't worry, Mr. Krabs,
I have everything under control.
但别担心，蟹老板，
一切都在我的掌控之中。

16:33.103 --> 16:33.241
It's, uh, all in here.
呃，一切都在这里。

16:34.379 --> 16:34.517
Really?
真的吗？

16:35.758 --> 16:37.931
Yup, right
in... here...
是的，没错
在……这里……

16:37.931 --> 16:38.034
Is there a problem?
有问题吗？

16:39.724 --> 16:39.862
Uh, your lawyer didn't give me
the combination.
呃，你的律师没有给我
的组合。

16:42.448 --> 16:42.586
Is the plaintiff
ready to proceed?
是否是原告
准备好继续了吗？

16:44.620 --> 16:44.758
Yes, Your Honor, I'll try.
是的，法官大人，我会尽力的。

16:47.620 --> 16:47.758
Ow. Ow. Ow. Ow.
噢。噢。噢。噢。

16:51.655 --> 16:51.793
I wasn't always
the tortured shell of a protozoa
我并不总是
原生动物饱受折磨的外壳

16:56.310 --> 16:56.448
that writhes in pain
before you today.
痛苦地翻滚
今天摆在你面前。

16:59.413 --> 16:59.551
I... was a vibrant carefree,
happy-go-lucky single cell.
我……曾经是一个充满活力、无忧无虑的人，
无忧无虑的单细胞。

17:08.965 --> 17:09.068
Pull yourself
together, boy.
拉自己
在一起吧，男孩。

17:10.931 --> 17:11.034
Then came the fateful day
that I paid an innocent visit
然后命运的一天到来了
我无意中拜访了

17:15.241 --> 17:15.379
to the deathtrap
known as the Krusty Krab.
走向死亡陷阱
被称为“蟹堡”。

17:18.413 --> 17:18.551
How's it coming, lad?
怎么样，小伙子？

17:20.103 --> 17:20.241
Don't worry, Mr. Krabs,
I'm on the case.
别担心，蟹老板，
我正在处理这个案子。

17:22.896 --> 17:23.000
Upon entering
said establishment,
进入后
所说的机构，

17:25.655 --> 17:25.793
I found myself
without any warning
我发现自己
没有任何警告

17:28.413 --> 17:28.551
slipping and finally falling
onto a hard, unforgiving floor
滑倒并最终跌倒
落在坚硬、无情的地板上

17:33.551 --> 17:33.689
that had been
intentionally
covered
那曾经是
故意地
覆盖

17:36.137 --> 17:36.275
with a vicious
fluid.
带着恶毒的
流体。

17:38.793 --> 17:38.931
Bombs away!
炸弹走开！

17:42.758 --> 17:42.896
[ metal rattling]
[金属嘎嘎声]

17:44.000 --> 17:44.137
PLANKTON:
Ahem!
浮游生物：
咳咳！

17:45.275 --> 17:45.413
Are you quite finished?
你已经完成了吗？

17:46.275 --> 17:46.413
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

17:47.344 --> 17:47.482
Where was I?
我当时在哪儿？

17:48.344 --> 17:48.482
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

17:49.586 --> 17:49.724
But the worst part is...
但最糟糕的是...

17:51.862 --> 17:51.965
my dreams of completing
a marathon,
我的梦想完成
一场马拉松，

17:54.655 --> 17:54.793
like I promised my old Grammy,
have been dashed.
就像我向老格莱美承诺的那样，
已被破折号。

17:58.689 --> 17:58.827
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

18:00.931 --> 18:01.034
I'm sorry, Gram-Gram!
对不起，格兰姆！

18:03.103 --> 18:03.241
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

18:04.137 --> 18:04.275
Sorry!
对不起！

18:06.448 --> 18:06.586
[ all sobbing]
[全都抽泣]

18:08.068 --> 18:08.206
Thank you for your
kind attention.
谢谢你的
善意的关注。

18:11.034 --> 18:11.172
[ softly]:
Suckers.
[轻声]：
傻瓜。

18:12.931 --> 18:14.758
Does the defense [ sobs] have
an opening statement?
防守[抽泣]有吗
开场白？

18:14.758 --> 18:14.896
Yes, Your Honor.
是的，法官大人。

18:16.172 --> 18:16.310
Poor Gram-Gram!
可怜的格拉姆格拉姆！

18:18.862 --> 18:18.965
Mr. Krabs, can you
identify this item?
蟹老板，你可以吗？
识别这个项目？

18:22.172 --> 18:22.310
KRABS:
It's a "Wet Floor" sign.
螃蟹：
这是一个“湿地板”的标志。

18:24.137 --> 18:24.275
Do you own one?
您拥有一个吗？

18:25.689 --> 18:25.827
Uh, well... um...
呃，呃……嗯……

18:28.724 --> 18:28.862
No, I don't.
不，我不。

18:29.931 --> 18:30.034
[ jurors gasp]
[陪审员喘息]

18:31.482 --> 18:31.620
No, no, you don't understand!
不不不，你不明白！

18:33.655 --> 18:33.793
I had to make some tough
business decisions
我必须做出一些艰难的事
商业决策

18:35.551 --> 18:35.689
and the sign seemed...
superfluous.
那个标志似乎...
多余的。

18:38.000 --> 18:38.103
[ jurors murmuring "guilty"]
[陪审员低声说“有罪”]

18:41.310 --> 18:41.448
No more questions.
没有更多问题了。

18:43.103 --> 18:43.241
JUDGE:
Your witness,
Mr. Lawyerpants.
法官：
你的见证人，
律师裤先生。

18:44.793 --> 18:44.931
Huh?
啊？

18:46.068 --> 18:46.206
Sometime today, Mr. Pants.
今天某个时候，裤子先生。

18:48.103 --> 18:48.241
May it please the court, ladies
and gentlemen of the jury,
女士们，愿法庭高兴
以及评审团的先生们，

18:51.034 --> 18:51.172
my client has been called
"cheap," "miserly,"
我的客户已接到电话
“便宜”、“吝啬”

18:54.000 --> 18:54.137
and "chronically
tightfisted."
和“长期
拳头紧。”

18:55.482 --> 18:55.620
Uh... um...
呃……嗯……

18:57.482 --> 18:57.620
But if he were as cheap
as the prosecution claims he is,
但如果他也这么便宜的话
正如检方声称的那样，

19:02.068 --> 19:02.206
would he be able
to sit there quietly
他能吗
静静地坐在那里

19:04.620 --> 19:04.758
while I took out a dollar and
dropped it in the blender?
当我拿出一美元并
把它掉进搅拌机里了？

19:07.655 --> 19:07.793
[ gasps]
[喘气]

19:09.620 --> 19:09.758
[ blender whirring]
[搅拌机嗡嗡作响]

19:10.689 --> 19:10.827
No! No! No!
不！不！不！

19:14.551 --> 19:14.689
Daddy's got you.
Daddy's got you.
爸爸有你。
爸爸有你。

19:16.034 --> 19:16.172
Daddy's here.
爸爸来了。

19:18.000 --> 19:18.103
[ murmuring in disgust]
[厌恶地低声说]

19:20.310 --> 19:20.448
Uh...
呃...

19:21.896 --> 19:22.000
A little glue,
a little tape--
胶水少许，
一小段胶带——

19:23.310 --> 19:23.448
you'll be right
as rain.
你是对的
如雨。

19:25.000 --> 19:25.103
Daddy didn't forget you.
爸爸没有忘记你。

19:27.241 --> 19:27.379
Uh...
呃...

19:28.931 --> 19:30.448
Does the defense have
any witness to call?
防守有没有
有证人可以传唤吗？

19:30.448 --> 19:30.586
Yes, Your Honor.
是的，法官大人。

19:32.034 --> 19:32.172
Defense calls...
国防部呼吁...

19:33.310 --> 19:33.448
Squidward to the stand.
章鱼哥走向看台。

19:35.275 --> 19:35.413
Ah, Squidward,
a loyal employee.
啊，章鱼哥，
忠诚的员工。

19:38.551 --> 19:38.689
SPONGEBOB:
Mister, uh,
Squidward is it?
海绵宝宝：
先生，呃，
是章鱼哥吗？

19:40.965 --> 19:41.068
My client
has been called
"cheap."
我的客户
已被称为
“便宜。”

19:42.758 --> 19:42.896
Would you agree with
that ludicrous statement?
你同意吗
那个可笑的说法？

19:45.206 --> 19:45.344
Yes.
是的。

19:46.172 --> 19:46.310
What?!
什么？！

19:47.310 --> 19:48.206
Allow me to rephrase
请允许我重新表述一下

19:48.206 --> 19:48.344
the question.
的问题。

19:49.896 --> 19:50.000
Can you tell the court
of some instance
你能告诉法庭吗
某些实例的

19:51.551 --> 19:51.689
of Mr. Krabs's generosity
in any way?
蟹老板的慷慨
以任何方式？

19:52.793 --> 19:52.931
Nope. Can I go now?
没有。我现在可以走了吗？

19:54.862 --> 19:54.965
One day off in three years and
I have to spend it testifying?
三年休息一天，
我必须花它去作证吗？

19:57.655 --> 19:57.793
[ jurors gasp;
murmur in disgust]
[陪审员们倒吸一口凉气；
厌恶地低语]

20:03.275 --> 20:03.413
Must... open... case.
必须……打开……箱子。

20:05.931 --> 20:06.034
So, it was youwho made
the floor slippery, wasn't it?
所以，是你创造了
地板很滑，不是吗？

20:11.137 --> 20:11.275
Answer the question!
回答问题！

20:13.068 --> 20:13.206
Need I remind you
you are under oath?
需要我提醒你吗
你已经宣誓了吗？

20:14.862 --> 20:14.965
I'm doomed.
我注定了。

20:17.206 --> 20:17.344
You may as well give up
on that case, me boy,
你也可以放弃
在这种情况下，我的孩子，

20:19.931 --> 20:20.034
my goose is cooked.
我的鹅煮熟了。

20:21.379 --> 20:21.517
[ gasps]
[喘气]

20:23.034 --> 20:23.172
Mr. Krabs,
I'm surprised at you.
蟹老板先生，
我对你感到惊讶。

20:26.000 --> 20:26.137
We can't give up just because
things look bleak.
我们不能仅仅因为
事情看起来很黯淡。

20:30.103 --> 20:30.241
This trial will be won
by what's in your heart,
这次审判一定会赢
根据你内心的想法，

20:33.241 --> 20:33.379
not what's in
this dumb old case.
不是里面的东西
这个愚蠢的老案例。

20:36.896 --> 20:37.000
It's open.
它是开放的。

20:38.689 --> 20:38.827
It's...
它是...

20:40.586 --> 20:40.724
It's just
his lunch.
这只是
他的午餐。

20:42.000 --> 20:42.103
Or is it?
或者是吗？

20:46.620 --> 20:46.758
Defense calls Plankton
to the stand.
国防部称浮游生物
到看台。

20:51.413 --> 20:51.551
Why did you go into
the Krusty Krab that day?
你为什么进入
那天的蟹堡王？

20:54.137 --> 20:54.241
To, you know, say hello to
my once-good-friend, Mr. Krabs.
向，你知道，打个招呼
我曾经的好朋友，蟹老板。

20:58.241 --> 20:58.379
What?
什么？

20:59.896 --> 21:00.068
Are you sure it wasn't
to make off
你确定不是吗
偷走

21:02.000 --> 21:02.137
with one of these?!
与其中之一？

21:03.241 --> 21:03.379
[ sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

21:06.482 --> 21:06.620
Gotcha.
明白了。

21:08.103 --> 21:08.241
Weren't you there
to steal the formula
你不在吗
窃取公式

21:11.172 --> 21:11.310
of the most delicious,
sweet-smelling sandwich
最美味的，
香甜的三明治

21:14.310 --> 21:14.448
known to Bikini Bottom?
知道比基尼底部吗？

21:16.344 --> 21:16.482
Krabby Patty...
克拉比帕蒂...

21:19.724 --> 21:19.862
[ groaning]
[呻吟]

21:29.689 --> 21:29.827
I can't take it!
我受不了！

21:31.965 --> 21:32.068
Give me!
给我！

21:33.517 --> 21:33.655
Give me!
Give me!
Give me!
给我！
给我！
给我！

21:34.517 --> 21:34.655
Yippee!
耶皮！

21:36.517 --> 21:36.655
Finally it's mine!
终于是我的了！

21:38.448 --> 21:38.586
KRABS:
I'll take that.
螃蟹：
我会接受的。

21:40.068 --> 21:40.206
Huh?
啊？

21:41.137 --> 21:41.275
No! No! No!
不！不！不！

21:42.758 --> 21:42.896
Once again, Plankton,
再一次，浮游生物，

21:44.793 --> 21:44.931
the sweetest
of life's joys
最甜蜜的
生活的乐趣

21:46.413 --> 21:46.551
has eluded
your grasp.
已经躲避了
你的把握。

21:49.344 --> 21:49.482
No! No! No! No!
不！不！不！不！

21:52.172 --> 21:52.310
Has the jury reached a verdict?
陪审团做出裁决了吗？

21:54.034 --> 21:54.137
We have, Your Honor.
我们有，法官大人。

21:55.655 --> 21:55.793
We find the defendant...
我们找到被告...

21:57.241 --> 21:57.379
not guilty!
无罪！

21:59.310 --> 21:59.448
But he is cheap.
但他很便宜。

22:00.620 --> 22:00.758
Thank you, SpongeBob.
谢谢你，海绵宝宝。

22:02.310 --> 22:02.448
I was foolish not
to accept your help
我是不是傻了
接受你的帮助

22:03.517 --> 22:03.655
from the beginning.
从一开始。

22:04.793 --> 22:04.931
That's okay, Mr. Krabs.
没关系，蟹老板。

22:06.000 --> 22:06.137
I made you a present.
我给你准备了一份礼物。

22:07.172 --> 22:07.310
A present for me?
给我的礼物？

22:09.724 --> 22:09.862
Close your eyes
and hold out your hand.
闭上眼睛
并伸出你的手。

22:13.103 --> 22:13.241
[ groans in pain]
[痛苦呻吟]

22:15.896 --> 22:16.000
SPONGEBOB:
It's a "Wet Floor" sign.
海绵宝宝：
这是一个“湿地板”的标志。

22:17.448 --> 22:17.586
I made it myself.
我自己做的。

22:18.586 --> 22:18.724
Well, it'll do.
嗯，会的。

22:19.827 --> 22:19.965
After all, it's free.
毕竟，它是免费的。

22:23.241 --> 22:23.379
Captioned by
Media Access Group at WGBH
标题为
WGBH 媒体访问小组

标题为
WGBH 媒体访问小组